msgid "MaxMind licence key"
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:402
msgid "The key is set in wp-config.php via WPSEC_MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY and cannot be edited here."
msgstr ""

#: admin/views/page-settings.php:404
msgid "A free GeoLite2 key from MaxMind. The database cannot be bundled with the plugin because MaxMind's licence forbids redistributing it. Defining WPSEC_MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY in wp-config.php keeps the key out of the database entirely."
